+    "## Task 1B. Outlier Detection and Data Cleaning (Modified z-score + Winsorization)\n",
+    "Detect outliers per feature using the modified z-score (median + MAD) and cap extreme values (winsorization) instead of dropping rows to preserve the sample size.\n",
+    "Outputs: outlier counts per feature, number of capped cells, and before/after boxplots."
